// SETUP, the whole thing:
//   1. Add the component to the panel you want to move — or to its title bar,
//      and drag the panel root into Panel To Move.
//   2. The panel (or title bar) needs a RAYCAST TARGET to receive drags: an
//      Image with Raycast Target ticked, which a panel background already is.
//      A bare label or an empty RectTransform receives nothing.
//   3. The Canvas needs a GraphicRaycaster and the scene an EventSystem —
//      both are added automatically when you create UI from the menu.
//   4. Set Drag Axis, and Limit Range if it should only travel so far.
// No code at all for the normal case.

// Only if your own code moves the panel afterwards, so the range is measured
// from where it actually ended up:
panel.SetHomeToCurrentPosition();
